WEBVTT

00:06:58.316 --> 00:07:00.716
who you see maybe every week.

00:07:01.156 --> 00:07:05.036
Even talking to strangers
has that benefit.

00:07:05.036 --> 00:07:08.116
So they did an experiment

00:07:08.116 --> 00:07:11.756
where they assigned some people
who were about to go on the subway

00:07:11.756 --> 00:07:14.596
the task of talking to a stranger

00:07:14.596 --> 00:07:16.556
while other people
were assigned the task

00:07:16.556 --> 00:07:19.796
of just doing their usual thing
of being on their phones

00:07:19.836 --> 00:07:21.916
or listening to music or reading.

00:07:22.236 --> 00:07:26.796
It turned out that the people
who were assigned to talk to strangers

00:07:26.796 --> 00:07:29.116
didn't think they were going to like it,

00:07:29.116 --> 00:07:33.236
but they turned out to be much happier
at the end of the task